+# TLS Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included; it is not disabled anywhere. This is reinforced by the project's standing decision to use HTTPS everywhere with no exceptions, so no host, internal or otherwise, is exempt from encrypted, verified connections.
